  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Caladium bicolor",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1279441814,
      "text": "Caladium bicolor, called Heart of Jesus, is a species in the genus Caladium from Latin America. It is grown as a houseplant for its large, heart or lance-shaped leaves with striking green, white, pink, and red blotching. Hundreds of cultivars are available. It can be planted outside in USDA Hardiness Zone 10 as an ornamental. It is a problematic invasive species in Trinidad and Tobago, Guam, Micronesia, Palau, Hawaii and the Philippines, and naturalized populations can be found in most of the rest of the world's tropics, including Africa, the Indian subcontinent, southeast Asia and Malesia."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Caladium bicolor",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 169202860,
      "text": "Caladium bicolor es una de las especies del género Caladium."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Caladium bicolor",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 234532639,
      "text": "Caladium bicolor est une espèce de plantes ornementales de la famille des Aracées. On la trouve dans les jungles tropicales. Elle mesure jusqu'à 40 cm de haut. Ses feuilles sont le plus souvent blanches ou rouges au centre et vertes sur les bords."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Tinhorão",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tinhor%C3%A3o",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 72808852,
      "text": "O tinhorão é uma planta bulbosa muito apreciada devido à sua folhagem ornamental. Ela apresenta folhas grandes, rajadas ou pintalgadas, com duas ou mais cores e tonalidades de branco, verde, rosa ou vermelho. As inflorescências têm importância ornamental secundária e são muito parecidas com as do lírio-da-paz, sendo brancas ou esverdeadas e podem ser pintalgadas como as folhas. A floração ocorre no verão. Também é conhecida pelos nomes de caládio, tajá, taiá e coração-de-jesus. Os nomes taiá e tajá têm origem no nome tupi da planta, taiá."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Caladium bicolor",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 28137988,
      "text": "Caladium bicolor adalah spesies keladi yang berasal dari Amerika Latin. Ia ditanam sebagai tanaman dalam ruangan karena daunnya yang besar, berbentuk hati atau tombak dengan bercak hijau, putih, merah muda, dan merah yang mencolok. Ratusan kultivar tersedia. Ia dapat ditanam di luar di Zona Ketahanan USDA 10 sebagai tanaman hias. Ia adalah spesies invasif yang bermasalah di Trinidad dan Tobago, Guam, Mikronesia, Palau, Hawaii, dan Filipina; serta populasi yang dinaturalisasi dapat ditemukan di sebagian besar daerah tropis lainnya di dunia termasuk Afrika, anak benua India, Asia Tenggara, dan Malesia."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "toxicity": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Caladium bicolor § Toxicity",
        "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor#Toxicity",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1279441814,
        "heading": "Toxicity",
        "text": "C. bicolor contains calcium oxalate crystals, making all parts of the plant poisonous to humans, livestock, and pets. Sap coming in contact with the skin may cause skin irritation. Ingestion may cause burning and swelling of the lips, mouth, and tongue, as well as nausea, vomiting, and diarrhea. If a pet consumes caladium, in addition to vomiting, etc., the symptoms include drooling, pawing at mouth or face, and decreased appetite.",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "es": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (es): Caladium bicolor § Toxicidad",
        "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor#Toxicidad",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 169202860,
        "heading": "Toxicidad",
        "text": "Caladium bicolor es altamente tóxica tanto para humanos como para mascotas debido a la presencia de cristales de oxalato de calcio. La ingestión de cualquier parte de la planta, así como el contacto ocular, puede provocar una variedad de síntomas, que incluyen:\nArdor en la boca y la garganta, Daño a la capa exterior del ojo, Diarrea, Dolor ocular, Voz ronca y dificultad para hablar, Aumento de la salivación, Náuseas o vómitos, Hinchazón y formación de ampollas en la boca y lengua.​",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "id": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (id): Caladium bicolor § Toksisitas",
        "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caladium_bicolor#Toksisitas",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 28137988,
        "heading": "Toksisitas",
        "text": "C. bicolor mengandung kristal kalsium oksalat, yang membuat semua bagiannya beracun bagi manusia, hewan ternak, dan hewan peliharaan. Getah yang bersentuhan dengan kulit dapat menyebabkan iritasi kulit. Menelannya dapat menyebabkan rasa terbakar dan bengkak pada bibir, mulut, dan lidah; serta mual, muntah, dan diare. Jika hewan peliharaan mengonsumsi keladi, gejalanya selain muntah dan lainnya meliputi keluar air liur, mencakar mulut atau wajah, dan nafsu makan menurun.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
